{"a":[33,33],"h":"<p>HATB, emri mühim, ya'ni bu müjdeden sonra asıl gönderilmenize sebeb olan iş nedir? <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"138\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 137.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 53.3 53.3 60.7 60.7 69.7 69.7 77.3 93.0 99.7 108.0 108.0 108.0 114.7\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 42.0 42.0 99.7 114.7 121.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ey mürseller - Allah tarafından gönderilmiş şanlı elçiler! 32. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"149\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 149.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 40.6 40.6 48.0 48.0 60.7 60.7 76.6 76.6 83.3 83.3 91.6 107.3 118.6 118.6 126.0 126.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 91.6 132.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> - ya'ni Lût kavmı 33.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"125\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 125.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 33.8 33.8 40.6 47.3 65.3 75.8 87.0 87.0 94.6 94.6 101.3 101.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"40.6 47.3 65.3 75.8 108.8\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> üzerlerine salmak için - memleketlerinin altını üstüne çevirdikten sonra üzerlerine yağdırmak için <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"142\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 142.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 53.3 53.3 63.7 63.7 79.6 79.6 86.3 94.6 101.3 114.0 114.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"86.3 101.3 126.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> çamurdan taşlar - çamurdan tehaccür etmiş siccîl 34. </p>"}